==Description==
'''Cool Shades Engineer''', is an exclusive sticker obtained from the [[Surf & Turf Battle Pass]]. It is obtained from Level 5 of the premium track, which had a cost of {{BeachBalls|120}} or {{Robux|112}} to unlock, with a total cost of {{BeachBalls|370}} or {{Robux|222}}. Prior to the 20% discount, it had a cost of {{Robux|140}} with a total cost of {{Robux|280}}.

==Appearance==
'''Cool Shades Engineer''' showcases the default [[Engineer]] skin with a grin on its face while wearing sunglasses. A guitar can be held while the emote is used.

==Update History==
*'''9 July 2025''' - [[v1.70.0]]
**'''Cool Shades Engineer''' added.
*'''3 September 2025''' - [[v1.73.0|v1.73.5a]]
**'''Cool Shades Engineer''' is no longer obtainable.



